license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/phenethol/stormwatch"
url: "https://stormwatch-4013.onrender.com/"
abstract: >-
  Mobile-friendly web application that shows official DHMZ weather station
  measurements and user-submitted severe weather reports on one map of
  Croatia. Developed by student team G08 StormBusters in the Software
  Engineering course at the Faculty of Electrical Engineering and Computing
  (FER), University of Zagreb.
